          %h2#References References
          %p
            Formalization of double dimensional reduction is discussed in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/rational+homotopy+theory"} rational homotopy theory
            in
          %ul
            %li#FSS16
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Domenico+Fiorenza"}> Domenico Fiorenza
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/T-Duality+from+super+Lie+n-algebra+cocycles+for+super+p-branes"} T-Duality from super Lie n-algebra cocycles for super p-branes
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1611.06536"} arXiv:1611.06536
          %p
            and in full
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+theory"} homotopy theory
            in
          %ul
            %li#BMSS18
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vincent+Braunack-Mayer"}> Vincent Braunack-Mayer
                ,
                = succeed "," do
