              \:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Supermembranes: the first fifteen weeks
              %strong 5
              189 (1988) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/0264-9381/5/1/023"}> doi:10.1088/0264-9381/5/1/023
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %h3#reduction_of_m5brane_to_d4brane Reduction of M5-brane to D4-brane
          %p
            The
